# lfo — the OS's own modulation of the fold, at block rate. The device smooths the dial 1/64 per block and then the
# LFO overwrites one word, which is the order the `lfo` directive reproduces: this is the page-3 path, tested instead of
# assumed. Depth 0.85 of the full range at 6 Hz is a slow west-coast breath; the peak check keeps it from clipping.
tempo 120
steps 16
tail 0.5
track lead
preset 140 128 0 120 220 20 0 0 128 0 128 255 0 128 100 255 0 0
lfo p1 6 0.85
note 0 A3 16 110
expect sound 0 16
expect peak_below -3
expect idle 24
